# 可在VS Code REST Client等工具中逐条执行。先按README初始化管理员。
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token = 在这里粘贴登录得到的access_token
@parcelId = 1
@exceptionId = 1
@pickupCode = 在这里填写本地信箱中的六位码

### 健康检查
GET {{base}}/api/health

### 登录（改成init时设置的密码）
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"请改成你设置的管理员密码"}

### 入库（重试保持request_key和全部参数相同）
POST {{base}}/api/parcels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"tracking_no":"SF-DEMO-001","recipient":"resident-001","phone":"13800000000","carrier":"测试快递","location":"A-01","request_key":"inbound-001"}

### 分页查询
GET {{base}}/api/parcels?status=stored&page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查看详情
GET {{base}}/api/parcels/{{parcelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 发送本地通知，再从data/mailbox.jsonl读取取件码
POST {{base}}/api/notifications/dispatch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"limit":20}

### 核验取件
POST {{base}}/api/parcels/{{parcelId}}/pickup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"recipient":"resident-001","pickup_code":"{{pickupCode}}"}

### 异常登记：应使用另一件仍在库的包裹
POST {{base}}/api/parcels/{{parcelId}}/exceptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"kind":"damaged","note":"包装破损，待核实"}

### 异常恢复（或将resolution改为return退回）
POST {{base}}/api/exceptions/{{exceptionId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"resolution":"restore","note":"核实后恢复在库"}

### 货架调整：仅在库或异常状态可调整
PATCH {{base}}/api/parcels/{{parcelId}}/location
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"location":"B-02"}

### 业务统计
GET {{base}}/api/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 滞留包裹
GET {{base}}/api/parcels/overdue?days=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 审计
GET {{base}}/api/audits?parcel_id={{parcelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CSV导出
GET {{base}}/api/parcels/export.csv
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 通知状态
GET {{base}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 新建工作人员
POST {{base}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"clerk1","password":"DemoClerk123!","role":"clerk"}

### 站长或管理员解除取件码锁定
POST {{base}}/api/parcels/{{parcelId}}/reset-pickup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
